{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If find object, approach and take it. Then inspect and perform subtask if possible. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = PerformSubtask    />\"",
